 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Asset Under Construction (BFH)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to manage Assets under Construction (AuC). Assets under Construction are a special form of tangible assets. They are usually displayed as a separate balance sheet item, requiring separate account determination, and their own asset classes. During the construction phase of an asset, all actual postings are assigned to the AuC. Once the asset is complete, a transfer is made to the final fixed asset.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Include invoice and final settlement for Assets under Construction (AuC)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create AuC assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Settle asset under construction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create assets for complete AuC settlement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain settlement rule for final settlement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Legacy AuC Assets</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get a transparent view of asset acquisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate efficient processing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>在建工程 (BFH)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使您能够管理在建工程 (AuC)。在建资产是一种特殊形式的有形资产。它们通常显示为单独的资产负债表项目，需要单独的科目确定及其自己的资产类。在资产建造阶段，所有实际过账都将分配到在建工程。资产完成后，将转移至最终固定资产。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">包括在建资产 (AuC) 的发票和最终结算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建在建资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">结算在建资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建资产以完成 AuC 结算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护最终结算的结算规则</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建历史在建资产</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof43b81eef1df4df7a5f0101b1353f6b3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获取资产购置的透明视图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化高效处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
